<title>UK: Buenos Aires sets 150 mln Swiss franc 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Buenos Aires sets 150 mln Swiss franc 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF BUENOS AIRES</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    23.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    23.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 MGT/UND    YES	 SELL CONC  NO</p>
<p> NOTES	END OF SUBSCRIPTION 11.OCT.96.</p>
<p>THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
